The '''Zephyr-J speeder bike''',<ref name="2024 Encyclopedia" /> also known as the '''Outer Rim speeder bike''',<ref name="Databank">{{Databank|outer-rim-speeder-bike|Outer Rim speeder bike}}</ref> was a model of [[speeder bike]] [[repulsorcraft]] manufactured by [[Mobquet Swoops and Speeders]]. They were commonly used in the [[Outer Rim Territories]],<ref name="Young Twitter" /> but could also be found on [[Core Worlds]] such as [[Coruscant]].<ref name="2024 Encyclopedia" /> 

While [[Hunt for Fennec Shand|hunting]] for [[Fennec Shand]] on [[Tatooine]], a Zephyr-J was purchase by [[Toro Calican]] for his companion [[Din Djarin]]. During the two's travels, Shand shot the bike with her [[785MK Firepuncher-X sniper rifle|MK sniper rifle]].<ref name="Chapter 5">{{TheMandalorian|Chapter 5: The Gunslinger}}</ref>

==Behind the scenes==
[[File:Zephyr-J.png|thumb|right|250px|Zephyr-J prop at Celebration Chicago]]
The Zephyr-J appeared in the [[2019]] [[Disney+]] television series ''[[Star Wars: The Mandalorian]]''. A screen-used prop of the speeder was revealed at [[Celebration Chicago]].<ref name="Young Twitter" />

